	(text "CFG1 selects 20 V default. Request 28 V only after\nsource/cable capability checks. I2C mux channel 7.\nVHV and VBUS share a filtered, protected supply.\nCC pins remain connected to raw CC.\nInput transients and CC shorts need bench qualification."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 205.74 0)
